> What happens if one player does a multiple rest command?  Is the other

As for resting, where's the problem? You get left behind if the others
won't wait for you, or they can help to heal/feed you, or whatever;
the WHOLE POINT of a multi-hack would be TEAMWORK, just as it would be
in a D&D game.

> What if one player wants to save the game while the other doesn't?

For saving, you're just gonna have to agree on game sessions; there's
no other way, unless you become transported forward in time, and hence
vanish with your gear from the point of view of the others; you could
land up where you left off, or rejoin the rest, or end up anywhere...
who cares? It's plausible, that's the point.

